{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","勇者连斩"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","向前方连续进行斩击，随后使出大范围的终结斩击。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向，对前方3格长、3格宽的所有敌人进行9次连续斩击，每次造成60% + 6% ATK伤害。之后使出大范围斩击，对前方所有敌人造成220% + 30% ATK伤害，并附带敌人15% + 2%最大生命值（最高不超过辛美尔300% + 30% ATK）的真实伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":94,"end":99,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":117,"end":123,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":69,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":113,"end":127,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","终结斩击伤害提高至240% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","终结斩击伤害提高至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","终结斩击伤害提高至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","终结斩击伤害提高至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","勇者瞬袭"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","瞬间移动至两名敌人身旁发动斩击并将其击倒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","先后瞬移到累计造成伤害最高的2名敌人身旁，分别对其造成340% + 40% ATK伤害并将其击倒2秒，随后回到原位置。辛美尔在本技能释放期间获得霸体状态。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":72,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至380% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","冒险伙伴"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","辛美尔在战斗开始时组建“冒险伙伴”；主动使用时，对前方敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，若辛美尔周围1格范围内同时存在法师、坦克与辅助职业的友军各一名，则与这三位友军组建“冒险伙伴”。辛美尔的精神会鼓舞所有“冒险伙伴”，提高其12% + 1%的基础属性，并且共享一个相当于辛美尔初始攻击力1500% + 100%的永久护盾。主动使用时，辛美尔对目标敌人造成4次120% + 20% ATK攻击力的伤害，并将造成伤害的30% + 2%转化为对所有“冒险伙伴”的治疗。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":78,"end":83,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":111,"end":118,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":146,"end":152,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":173,"end":178,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":142,"end":156,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，每段造成的伤害提高至140% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，每段造成的伤害提高至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，每段造成的伤害提高至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升自身急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提高12点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提高16点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提高20点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","苍月草的祝福"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，战场中会吹过苍月草花瓣附加祝福效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，战场中会吹过苍月草花瓣附加祝福效果，对“冒险伙伴”带来永久属性增益：坦克和辅助成员获得相当于辛美尔初始攻击力150%的最大生命值、法师成员和辛美尔获得相当于辛美尔初始攻击力8%的攻击力。若芙莉莲作为“冒险伙伴”登场，则辛美尔会为其带上花环，并且永久提升自身和芙莉莲30点穿透。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","坦克和辅助成员获得相当于辛美尔初始攻击力200%的最大生命值、法师成员和辛美尔获得相当于辛美尔初始攻击力10%的攻击力"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","持续作战10秒后，苍月草的祝福将会再次从场中吹过，为场中所有“冒险伙伴”恢复40%最大生命值并驱散所有减益状态，此时每有一名“冒险伙伴”存活，将会提升辛美尔12%的攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","坦克和辅助成员获得相当于辛美尔初始攻击力250%的最大生命值、法师成员和辛美尔获得相当于辛美尔初始攻击力12%的攻击力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","辛美尔和他的伙伴对首领敌人造成的生命损耗效果增加。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","辛美尔拥有讨伐魔王的不屈的精神。在首领模式中，辛美尔及其“冒险伙伴”对首领敌人造成的生命损耗效果提高12%。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","辛美尔的剑"]]}